 "title": "Finite-extension geometric-fiber formula",
 "statement": "In the setup of the finite-level geometric-fiber corollary, let $E/\\Ql$ be\nfinite and let $K\\in\\Dbc(X,E)$. The $E$-coefficient exchange morphism is an\nisomorphism\n$$\n L\\bar y^*Rf_*K\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\n Ra_{\\bar y,*}Li_{\\bar y}^*K\n \\quad\\text{in }\\Dbc(\\operatorname{Spec}\\Omega,E).\n$$",
